==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Type 10 (Hometown Self-Defense Force)|Type 10]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A relatively easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

